      "text": "1.  Learned Advocate for Applicants informs to the Court that SLP is pending in the Supreme Court involving question of power of Court to condone delay of more than 60 days caused in filing appeal under Right to Fair Compensation And Transparency in Land Acquisition Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act, 2013.\n2.",
